      "content": "the pressure of trying to be a good parent while everything is just falling apart... it makes me feel so selfish. i spend so much of my energy just worrying about how my stress affects them. like, if i wasn't here, they'd finally have a chance to just be happy without me dragging them down. do you think that's crazy?",
